{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"nets\":{\"big\":\"Y\",\"small\":\"Y\",\"core\":\"Y\",\"concise\":\"平\",\"human\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"X\",\"load\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"big：Y每屏都有清楚的叙事大字，能交代人物当下的处境和变化；X多数屏没有大字主线，单看大字难以串起全曲。small：Y的小字基本能贴着人物处境补充具体体验，读了有增量，不读也能靠大字理解；X不少屏只能靠小字承担主要内容。core：Y完整呈现了离开、怀念、孤独、重新审视离开决定，最后带着怀念继续维护尊严的过程；X的核心意思虽然存在，但容易被大量感受和意象冲散。concise：平，X有相邻感受近义重复，如S03对轻松是否真实的两次表达、S04对记忆美好的重复；Y也有多处大小字重复，如S06想念浮现、S11害怕仍向前走，双方各有问题。human：Y整体口语关系更清楚；X有“负隅顽抗”“历经许多之后，仍未能获得彻底答案的疲惫”等书面摘要腔，部分表达不像普通人自然说话。fine：X胜，像“伸出颤抖的手去摸，摸到的却只有虚空”“像脚下原有的地板忽然不见了”这样的体验更有辨识度；Y不少感受直接转向节奏、旋律和和弦的描述，观众自身的体验相对少一些。load：X胜，大字块少且长度适中；Y在S06、S10、S11、S12、S13等屏安排了多段较长大字，尤其S11只有22秒、S12只有25秒，扫读压力明显更大。\"} </escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b41cf49e-de2a-44dc-a94e-fafe11cadc0d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T194907643684Z", "elapsed_seconds": 222.703, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T19:52:50.355431+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9affca05eead2737b8fc23b01586ea02cbccbc658d2470a25d238d49eddfe49c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"too